[{"client_msg_id":"2575f944-db15-43b2-a27a-d4ea87b82813","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"自動登録時はエラーを無視するようにするのが良さそうかな","ts":"1629039219.357800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zbK9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7492fe3-cc0d-4577-a450-ce7b0d3ed717","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"なるほど、どうしようかなぁ","ts":"1629039069.357400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Azboj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"354d5057-a63d-45c5-9f95-a1558188bf6c","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"自動登録プラグインは手動登録する必要はないというのはその通りですが、そうなるとdenopsと同時にすべて読み込むことになり遅延起動の恩恵を受けづらくなるなと。\n今はよいですけど今後プラグイン増えるとね","ts":"1629038944.357100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d638"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c6a9341-c3ce-45a3-8406-2cfa2e950968","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"プラグイン側が手動で登録すると自動登録時にエラーなので困ったわけです","ts":"1629038849.355000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lG6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2eb51f0b-86d5-49d9-bb47-2853e682bcb9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"こんかいもんだいになったのは","ts":"1629038820.354200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dcjA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67e01efe-68fd-45f7-acd5-4e0d50aaa534","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あー、denops側でどうにかならないかなと思いまして","ts":"1629038817.354000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y6t1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d03caf4-b988-4ae4-91e2-122c6ad2cbbd","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"個別の登録状態というより自動登録が走ったか走ってないかこれが分かるだけでよいと思うのです","ts":"1629038810.353700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u+Wo3"}]},{"client_msg_id"